## Motivation

The inception of this "atelier" website traces back to a minor dispute I had with my father, whom had made a personal portfolio style website to display his projects.\
I found his website to be quite plain and generally visually uninspiring, and gave him my criticisms plainly, to which he replied with his usual "It's sooo~ easy to ciritise" and of course what he's really saying is:

> _but it is so much harder to actually do_

Essentially challenging me to create a website of my own, to which I accacpted and promised I would create a cooler website.
During this time, I was a fan of Arknights and I had been itching to create something inspired by that style, so the idea came about that I shall imitate the dark, grungy, tech-look of Arknights.

